{"event": "section_start", "payload": {"title": "planning_round_3", "payload": {"prompt": "User request:\nsearch emails from today 2026/04/10 , read each and then summerize them\n\nTool catalog prompt:\nYou are a tool-planning assistant for a Gmail MCP client.\n\nSelect the smallest set of tools needed to satisfy the user request.\n\nReturn JSON only. No markdown, no explanation, no backticks.\n\nUse this exact shape: {\"chosenTools\":[{\"name\":\"tool_name\",\"reason\":\"why\",\"arguments\":{}}]}\n\nRules:\n\n- Only use tools from the provided catalog.\n\n- If no tool is needed, return an empty chosenTools array.\n\n- If you choose a tool, include only arguments that are supported by its schema.\n\nRelevant tools:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"search_emails\",\n    \"description\": \"Searches for emails using Gmail search syntax\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"query\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Gmail search query (e.g., 'from:example@gmail.com')\"\n        },\n        \"maxResults\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"description\": \"Maximum number of results to return\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"query\"\n      ],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"read_email\",\n    \"description\": \"Retrieves the content of a specific email\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"messageId\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"ID of the email message to retrieve\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"messageId\"\n      ],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"download_attachment\",\n    \"description\": \"Downloads an email attachment to a specified location\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"messageId\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"ID of the email message containing the attachment\"\n        },\n        \"attachmentId\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"ID of the attachment to download\"\n        },\n        \"filename\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Filename to save the attachment as (if not provided, uses original filename)\"\n        },\n        \"savePath\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Directory path to save the attachment (defaults to current directory)\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"messageId\",\n        \"attachmentId\"\n      ],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\"\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nUser request:\n\nsearch emails from today 2026/04/10 , read each and then summerize them\n\nTool outputs so far:\nMCP return for search_emails\nArguments: {\"query\": \"after:2026/04/10 before:2026/04/11\"}\nRaw payload: {\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"ID: 19d799bc23dd2cd4\\nSubject: Your deal-icious offers are waiting\\ud83d\\ude0a\\nFrom: Tim Hortons <promo@promo.timhortons.ca>\\nDate: Fri, 10 Apr 2026 22:55:42 +0000\\n\\nID: 19d79366902a95fd\\nSubject: Aryan, looking for a new job?\\nFrom: LinkedIn <jobs-noreply@linkedin.com>\\nDate: Fri, 10 Apr 2026 21:04:58 +0000 (UTC)\\n\\nID: 19d79219c4e65885\\nSubject: Aryan, score an early look at our Micro RGB TV\\nFrom: Samsung Electronics Canada <samsungca@ca.email.samsung.com>\\nDate: Fri, 10 Apr 2026 21:41:32 +0100\\n\\nID: 19d7910995dc391e\\nSubject: First Look: Grail Sale S/S '26 \\ud83d\\udc40\\nFrom: Grailed <news@mail.grailed.com>\\nDate: Fri, 10 Apr 2026 20:23:42 +0000 (UTC)\\n\\nID: 19d78d8b2e2d9d00\\nSubject: New Arrivals: City essentials & mor